---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Docs">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner docs">
      <p class="eyebrow">Docs</p>
      <h1>FantomMarketCap reference</h1>
      <p class="lead">A concise guide to reading Fantom token data, DEX rankings, and on-chain signals.</p>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>How rankings work</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Tokens are ranked by market cap calculated from circulating supply and current price.</li>
          <li>Nativity markers show whether an asset is native (⁕), bridged (*), or a stablecoin.</li>
          <li>Liquidity scores reflect the deepest DEX pool available for each token pair.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Categories explained</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>DEX / AMM</strong> — Automated market makers and swap protocols on Fantom Opera.</li>
          <li><strong>Farming / Yields</strong> — Protocols emitting rewards for liquidity provision or staking.</li>
          <li><strong>Vaults</strong> — Auto-compounding strategies that harvest and reinvest rewards.</li>
          <li><strong>Stablecoins</strong> — Pegged assets used for low-volatility collateral and trading.</li>
          <li><strong>Bridges</strong> — Cross-chain infrastructure moving assets between Fantom and other networks.</li>
          <li><strong>Tools / Oracles</strong> — Price feeds, analytics, charting, and infrastructure.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .docs {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 22px;
    color: #354052;
  }

  pre {
    overflow: auto;
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #111827;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 18px;
  }
</style>
